The stylesheets under `css/` (excluding `css/extended/`, which is Allan's
own) were vendored from the hugo-PaperMod theme
(https://github.com/adityatelange/hugo-PaperMod) at commit
a020be2137458dd0a1f4f3a024cd7b076931e9e3, and are distributed here under the
original MIT licence below.

PaperMod's templates were also vendored at that commit, under `layouts/`, but
were removed when the site moved from Hugo to the Python generator in
`generator/`; no PaperMod template code remains. The stylesheets moved from
`assets/css/` to `css/` in the same change.

